## Model card

- **Name:** Ling 3.2 Flash
- **Short description:** Purported successor to inclusionAI's Ling 3.x Flash line (Ling-3.1-flash, Ling-3.0-flash). As of 2026-11-10 no Ling 3.2 Flash model card, weights, or tracked leaderboard entry exists in public sources — the slug was queued in this dataset but the release is unverified/absent publicly.
- **Provider / access:** unknown — no catalog route found (inclusionAI Hugging Face org lists only up to Ling-3.1-flash / Ling-3.1-flash-1019; models.dev catalog, 1311 models, contains no `ling-3.2-flash` entry; BenchLM 404).
- **Release / knowledge:** unknown — no announcement found.
- **IDs:** `ling-3.2-flash` (as tracked by this dataset; vendor route not found)
- **Context window:** unknown (Ling 3.1 Flash sibling: 262,144 ctx / 32,768 out, per models.dev).
- **Modalities:** unknown (Ling 3.x Flash siblings are text in / text out).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** no verified public price found.
- **Architecture:** presumably inclusionAI `bailing_hybrid` MoE (family); unverified for this SKU.

